# Route: guide 13 of 51 of the simulator's completionist route for Undead
# (1199 of 1215 eligible quests, 157.8 h, world baeac23fbe5e): levels 30 to
# 32, 40 quests, 5.0 h under the model. The order is the simulator's (`sim run
# --objective completionist`, then `sim export`; docs/SIMULATION.md §10): fix
# a step in the exporter or the data, not only here, so the next export keeps
# it.
#
# Flow (Stonetalon Mountains, Hillsbrad Foothills, Alterac Mountains): Sun
# Rock Retreat -> Malaka'jin -> Grimtotem Post -> Camp Aparaje -> Sishir
# Canyon -> Webwinder Path -> Malaka'jin -> Sun Rock Retreat -> The Charred
# Vale -> Sun Rock Retreat -> Webwinder Path -> Windshear Crag -> Webwinder
# Path -> ….
#
# Optional (elite: grouping up is advised): Arachnophobia (6284; Besseleth
# 21); Bloodfury Bloodline (6283; Bloodfury Ripper 26).
#
# Profession quests here are not routed (they need the skill): 7321 Soothing
# Turtle Bisque.
#
# Left to other guides: class quests (the Class category); dungeon quests (the
# Dungeons guides): The Grave Knight (96986), Heart of Disruption (96984), The
# Grave Knight (96986), Opportunistic Education (96987).

